{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:39a1390ff55032c9","name":"Binder Cuffs","source":{"id":"source:reference-39a1390ff55032c9","title":"Binder Cuffs","revision":16217,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:31Z","sha256":"a110705803fcfcb873189f5805ae083445c1499c97c6c118e5580cd3eb837eb4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16217","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Binder%20Cuffs&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-39a1390ff55032c9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 50\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Binder Cuffs are durasteel restraints designed to lock two limbs of a prisoner together, normally the wrists or ankles, but it is possible to lock one arm to one leg or use the Binder Cuffs to hook a prisoner to a tree. The cuffs have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10, 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," score of 40. Breaking them requires a DC 30 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," check, and removing them without the seven-digit release code requires a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. The Binder Cuffs can be attached to the limbs of any creature of Large, Medium, or Small size.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
